# Docs ↔ Code Sync Rule

The three specs in `docs/` form the architectural source of truth:

| File                                   | Owns (authoritative)                                                                                       |
|----------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| `docs/strategy_full_pipeline.md`       | End-to-end architecture, data contracts (dataclasses, tensor shapes), Stage A + Stage B orchestration, replay-buffer layout, env / camera / reward spec, A/B test framing, Mamba streaming. **Architectural tiebreaker.** |
| `docs/module_pointpillar.md`           | `PointPillarsNeckExtractor` API + depth-camera preprocessing helpers. Dependency list (lean stack).        |
| `docs/strategy_finetune_with_SAC.md`   | SAC internals: Actor/Critic MLP on proprio, BN-lock hook, freeze regimes S1/S2/S3, SAC hyperparameters, optimizer groups, debugging checklist. |

Whenever the code changes, or an idea/design changes, update the owning doc first, then propagate cross-references.

